Cell["\<\
The ball of radius 3 in the tilings by triangles, five, six and seven at \
every vertex: on the sphere it is the whole icosahedron, in the hyperbolic \
plane it has the most vertices.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"5f3ac7f2-6294-43e5-8b92-8f9e9bc2ba30"],

