Cell["\<\
In the plane the ball grows like the square of the radius, in the hyperbolic \
plane exponentially. The vertex counts of the triangular tilings with six and \
seven triangles at a vertex:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"2ac2d6c9-38e1-43a3-832e-cdc73a780bd1"],

